        <!-- Pressure section optional. Omit entirely to use the SPS defaults shown below.
            maxPressure     : ±bar ceiling; HUD reads from -this to +this
            minThreshold    : bar of stored pressure needed before flow can start
            minBuildTime    : seconds to reach max at a FULL tank (fast build)
            maxBuildTime    : seconds to reach max at an EMPTY tank (slow build); scales by fill ratio
            fallTimeWorking : seconds max->0 while fluid is still transferring (slow taper)
            fallTimeEmpty   : seconds max->0 while venting with no transfer (faster)
            purgeTime       : seconds to vent max->0 when flipping direction against stored pressure
            openTop         : true = passive open-top vessel (FRC-style), never holds pressure, no gauge

            Battioni Pagani Pompe MEC/8000/M
            Tank capacity : 10,911 litres

            Pump nameplate:
              Max pressure : +3.5 bar
              Max vacuum   : -2.5 bar
              Max power    : 24 kW
              Max speed    : 600 rpm
              Max capacity : 8,100 l/min

            Approx theoretical empty-tank build times:
              Atmospheric tank-volume displacement : ~81 sec
              Vacuum to -0.94 bar                  : ~213 sec (pump efficiency falls off near full vacuum)
              Pressure to +1.5 bar                 : ~120 sec

            Realistic SPS tuning:
              minBuildTime    : 12 sec
              maxBuildTime    : 140 sec
              fallTimeWorking : 48 sec
              fallTimeEmpty   : 30 sec
              purgeTime       : 14 sec

            [SPS 1.0.2.0] Pressure and vacuum now have their own limits: maxPressure is the positive limit (+1.5 bar),
            maxVacuum the negative one as a magnitude (0.94 = -0.94 bar). Every *Vacuum attribute is optional and falls
            back to its pressure twin. The vacuum build is slower than the pressure build (real pumps pull
            harder at the start and fall off near full vacuum), so its build times are longer. -->
        <pressure maxPressure="3.5" minThreshold="0.30" minBuildTime="20" maxBuildTime="150" fallTimeWorking="60" fallTimeEmpty="35" purgeTime="16" maxVacuum="2.5"
					minThresholdVacuum="0.20" minBuildTimeVacuum="28" maxBuildTimeVacuum="220" fallTimeWorkingVacuum="50" fallTimeEmptyVacuum="30" openTop="false"/>

